  <h2>Who I Am</h2>

  <p>I'm a senior technical leader who thrives on tackling complex challenges across AI, cloud architecture, and data engineering. My journey has taken me from building AI for AAA games to architecting AI-powered supply chain platforms, always with one constant: a passion for technical excellence and business impact.</p>

  <p>What sets me apart is my ability to operate effectively at any level:</p>

  <h3>🏗️ As an Architect</h3>
  <p>I design scalable, modular, and business-focused architectures for cloud, data, and AI systems. My specializations include:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>AI Architecture</strong>: LLM implementation in enterprise environments</li>
    <li><strong>MLOps</strong>: Production-ready machine learning systems</li>
    <li><strong>Agent AI</strong>: Autonomous AI systems that deliver business value</li>
    <li><strong>Cloud-Native Systems</strong>: Serverless, microservices, and distributed architectures</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>👥 As a Leader</h3>
  <p>I build and mentor high-performing teams that ship high-quality code. My leadership philosophy centers on:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Empowerment</strong>: Giving teams the autonomy to excel</li>
    <li><strong>Growth</strong>: Continuous learning and skill development</li>
    <li><strong>Culture</strong>: Building positive, collaborative environments</li>
    <li><strong>Delivery</strong>: Balancing speed with quality and sustainability</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>🎯 As a Strategist</h3>
  <p>With a strong business analysis background, I ensure technical roadmaps align perfectly with business goals:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Business-First Thinking</strong>: Technology serves business objectives</li>
    <li><strong>ROI Focus</strong>: Every technical decision ties to business value</li>
    <li><strong>Risk Management</strong>: Proactive identification and mitigation</li>
    <li><strong>Strategic Planning</strong>: Long-term vision with short-term wins</li>
  </ul>

